> Original GunPoint observations and saved fitting statistics

Use genuine150-sample hand x-coordinate sequences from the pinned official
GunPoint archive. Original class1gun-draw/class2pointing become0/1. All150
official test records stay unchanged. Seed407 holds20% per class out of the
50 original training records,giving40fit/10validation. Source records are
disjoint;the original two actors remain shared dependencies. This is not
actor-disjoint or a tuned benchmark evaluation.

The435,433-byte archive SHA256 and exact original source IDs/raw strings are
retained by dm::datasets::prepare_example_data("signals").
Numeric input ingress becomes Float32 tensors. Fitting-only Double population
mean/std round to Float32 and are saved as detached scalar state. Inference
prefixes never estimate new normalization. The released signals already have
archive preprocessing;network causality does not establish an online raw-sensor
pipeline whose source preprocessing never saw future samples.

```{cpp, flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
#include <dm/dm.hpp>
int main() {
  const std::filesystem::path cache = dm::datasets::data_home();
  dm::datasets::prepare_example_data("signals", cache);
}
