\caption(All15 Adam updates with explicit tensor global-norm clipping. Fitting uses keep.8 dropout;validation uses unchanged saved fitting normalization and no dropout.)
\alttext(All15 Adam updates with explicit tensor global-norm clipping. Fitting uses keep.8 dropout;validation uses unchanged saved fitting normalization and no dropout.)


\image(figures/tcn_metrics.svg)
\caption(Held-out predictors:0learned TCN,1untrained TCN,2raw1NN,3SGD centroid,4class0 majority tie. Onehot and distance references have declared pseudo-logit NLL;they are not calibrated probability fits.)
