\alttext(Exact recorded true-row predicted-column counts rendered by the confusion-matrix SVG API.)

> Conclusion

The report verifies causal connectivity and exposes every optimizer operation. Saved normalization and unchanged prefix predictions establish the declared observed-input contract;the actual held-out comparisons determine classification quality. Neither structural causality nor reduced fitting loss is an accuracy claim.

> References

- [Bai,Kolter and Koltun(2018),An Empirical Evaluation of Generic Convolutional and Recurrent Networks for Sequence Modeling](https://arxiv.org/abs/1803.01271).
- [Salimans and Kingma(2016),Weight Normalization](https://arxiv.org/abs/1602.07868).
- [Official GunPoint observations](https://www.timeseriesclassification.com/description.php?Dataset=GunPoint).
